#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:5
#: 6a013ba4b0c0416a9744f0c30c99a127
msgid "Startup Options"
msgstr "启动选项"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:7
#: c5359ba874604962a89841018ebbe26d
msgid ""
"There are no mandatory command line options for MAVProxy. An exception to "
"this is the ``--master`` option if there is more than 1 APM connected to the"
" system."
msgstr "MAVProxy 没有强制性的命令行选项。但当系统连接了多个 APM 时，``--master`` 选项则是必须的。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:11
#: 5b4ff8fe15d34ff2aaeee137978df064
msgid ""
"Note that MAVProxy can only connect to 1 vehicle at a time. If control of "
"multiple vehicles is desired, multiple MAVProxy sessions should be used - "
"one session for each vehicle."
msgstr "请注意，MAVProxy 每次只能连接 1 架飞行器。若需控制多架飞行器，应使用多个 MAVProxy 会话，每架飞行器对应一个会话。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:16
#: 8d16a8bb828844c0be5d0efb3bb1d714
msgid "-\\-master"
msgstr "-\\-master"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:18
#: 6c270d488d9f4410a4932b55670194e8
msgid ""
"Specifies which port (serial, USB or network address/port) the UAV is "
"communicating on."
msgstr "指定无人机进行通信的端口（串行、USB 或网络地址/端口）。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:21
#: 23084234b7c14eba8059653dc2facf42
msgid ""
"Multiple ``--master`` can be used. MAVProxy will sort the packets into a "
"single stream automatically. This is useful if independent redundant links "
"are being used."
msgstr "可使用多个 ``--master``。MAVProxy 将自动将数据包整合为单一数据流。适用于使用独立冗余链路的场景。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:25
#: 0efefb1c343840279918876abf67a8b6
msgid ""
"If an IP address is specified, it must be the local computer's IP address, "
"or loopback address. The IP connection type (TCP or UDP) must be prefixed to"
" the IP address."
msgstr "如果指定 IP 地址，必须是本机 IP 地址或回环地址。IP 连接类型（TCP 或 UDP）必须以前缀形式添加到 IP 地址前。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:29
#: 3253145051994f619a33a937686bcd81
msgid ""
"If a serial port is specified, an optional comma-separated baud rate may "
"also be specified. If present, this overrides the rate given by "
"``--baudrate``."
msgstr "如果指定串口，还可以选择以逗号分隔的方式附加波特率。若存在，此设置将覆盖 ``--baudrate`` 指定的速率。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:43
#: e54132b289eb4aa3bd6dcfb495e8b3fc
msgid ""
"If connecting to a remote IP address, the udpout or tcpout arguments should "
"be used:"
msgstr "如果连接到远程 IP 地址，应使用 udpout 或 tcpout 参数："

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:51
#: 2ac1189ac33b4f34ad1b4ddd6482d06e
msgid "-\\-quadcopter"
msgstr "-\\-quadcopter"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:53
#: 9e5f28444a234480962486c92e0a4fc6
msgid "Use quadcopter controls."
msgstr "使用四旋翼控制方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:56
#: 71c4e6616072483a9bedd623fed35364
msgid "-\\-baudrate"
msgstr "-\\-baudrate"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:58
#: 1267c81d01244869a09500ff59f843db
msgid ""
"Specify baudrate of ``--master`` and ``--out`` ports. Only applicable for "
"serial links."
msgstr "指定 ``--master`` 和 ``--out`` 端口的波特率。仅适用于串行链路。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:62
#: aff4ac7f681b4a91b22b193ed67cd1a6
msgid "-\\-out"
msgstr "-\\-out"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:64
#: 1bd82d77007447d383da4243f28d3192
msgid ""
"Forward the MAVLink packets to a remote device (serial, USB or network "
"address/port). Useful if using multiple ground station computers or relaying"
" the stream through an intermediate node."
msgstr "将 MAVLink 数据包转发到远程设备（串行、USB 或网络地址/端口）。适用于使用多个地面站计算机或通过中间节点中继数据流的场景。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:68
#: 703847be9d5c436d91bdd7749503a0ca
msgid ""
"MAVlink usually uses port 14550 for IP-based packet forwarding, though other"
" ports can be used if needed."
msgstr "MAVLink 通常使用端口 14550 进行基于 IP 的数据包转发，但如有需要，也可使用其他端口。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:71
#: 9ba464189e964df686dd6015bbb118dd
msgid ""
"If a serial port is given (for example a radio device connecting an airborne"
" MAVProxy instance with the GCS), a link-specific baud rate can be given "
"after the device, delimited by a comma. This overrides the global default "
"baudrate specified by ``--baudrate``."
msgstr ""
"如果指定串口（例如连接空中 MAVProxy 实例与地面站的无线电设备），可在设备名后以逗号分隔的方式指定链路专用波特率，此设置将覆盖 "
"``--baudrate`` 指定的全局默认波特率。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:76
#: c6edb9e99ee34822854326d59f38b5e5
msgid ""
"If forwarding to a network address via tcp or udp, this must be prefixed "
"before the IP address."
msgstr "如果通过 tcp 或 udp 转发到网络地址，必须在 IP 地址前添加相应前缀。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:79
#: a0f3ce256b0d47c2b8b2fc9945fa6467
msgid ""
"A UDP broadcast can be made via the udpbcast:<ip>:<port> that starts as UDP "
"broadcast then locks onto the first client that connects. <ip> specifies the"
" valid client range. For example, udpbcast:192.168.2.255:14550 will connect "
"to the first client in the 192.168.2.0 to 192.168.2.254 range on port 14550."
msgstr ""
"可通过 udpbcast:<ip>:<port> 进行 UDP 广播，该方式以 UDP 广播开始，然后锁定首个连接的客户端。<ip> "
"指定有效的客户端范围。例如，udpbcast:192.168.2.255:14550 将连接到 192.168.2.0 至 192.168.2.254 "
"范围内在端口 14550 上的第一个客户端。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:93
#: b6af332ddaed4a86a338aff5eb2665e6
msgid "-\\-sitl"
msgstr "-\\-sitl"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:95
#: 9f0086b9406b42618ab4966ef192394b
msgid ""
"Host and port to send simulated RC input for the Software in the loop (SITL)"
" simulator. Usually ``--sitl=127.0.0.1:5501``"
msgstr "用于向软件在环（SITL）仿真器发送模拟 RC 输入的主机和端口。通常为 ``--sitl=127.0.0.1:5501``"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:98
#: 4fb6a15feaec44debaf097bebe348b49
msgid "-\\-streamrate"
msgstr "-\\-streamrate"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:100
#: d90cfa411e3c498496a46cda83ca1c11
msgid "MAVLink stream rate."
msgstr "MAVLink 数据流速率。"

