msgstr "MAVLink 主日志文件名称。默认为 mav.tlog。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:128
#: 3798dfd82ced425888608fb2ffc481c5
msgid "-\\-append-log"
msgstr "-\\-append-log"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:130
#: b346e4ca92b34e1289084f9b6ac9a3f6
msgid ""
"Append to latest log file, rather than creating a new one. Useful if re-"
"connecting mid-flight."
msgstr "追加到最新的日志文件，而非创建新文件。适用于飞行途中重新连接的场景。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:134
#: 21e03258e07e4db0bec976342363b438
msgid "-\\-setup"
msgstr "-\\-setup"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:136
#: 42494cc4950b4f24b59acc1cb98defee
msgid "Startup in the APM's command line interface (CLI) mode."
msgstr "以 APM 命令行界面（CLI）模式启动。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:139
#: 3691ae35ba1b4b308efd45527c990509
msgid "-\\-nodtr"
msgstr "-\\-nodtr"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:141
#: e83f62292f5a4d47aeddf77faedd73dc
msgid "Disable DTR drop on close."
msgstr "关闭时禁用 DTR 拉低。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:144
#: cfa92972d372439cbb46a33dcae18f2e
msgid "-\\-show-errors"
