#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:154
#: dbb755ea1ee8421da0bee70ed7ee1dce
msgid "-\\-aircraft"
msgstr "-\\-aircraft"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:156
#: 87a871c1431449048fc53f9e702e4471
msgid ""
"Name of the aircraft being flown. If used, logfiles will be stored in "
"**/Logs/AircraftName/Date/flightNumber/flight.tlog**. Useful for keeping "
"flight logs organised."
msgstr ""
"飞行器的名称。若使用此选项，日志文件将存储在 **/Logs/AircraftName/Date/flightNumber/flight.tlog** "
"路径下，便于整理飞行日志。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:161
#: b042a53d82384f079d06fa3beabd604d
msgid "-\\-cmd"
msgstr "-\\-cmd"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:163
#: ee0d0984433546dbaee4763c4e092885
msgid "Initial commands to run in MAVProxy. Delimited by ``;``"
msgstr "MAVProxy 启动时执行的初始命令，以 ``;`` 分隔"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:170
#: f8fdeb6ba88e44ed886e0680bf2ce096
msgid "-\\-console"
msgstr "-\\-console"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:172
#: 8a2d8d813946494a8506c2cbcae2954e
msgid "Load the GUI console module on startup."
msgstr "启动时加载 GUI 控制台模块。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:175
#: 9bce4a9ff1a243ed99ba14317c583797
msgid "-\\-map"
msgstr "-\\-map"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:177
#: 9a006fb452174c0b9a456515f4437dee
msgid "Load the moving map module on startup."
msgstr "启动时加载移动地图模块。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:180
#: 500c28a64ec844e09045fa6ebfd0cfa9
msgid "-\\-load-module"
msgstr "-\\-load-module"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:182
#: cfda429821164daeba692ca22661bad1
msgid ""
"Load the specified module on startup. Can be used multiple times, or with a "
"comma separated list."
msgstr "启动时加载指定模块。可多次使用，或以逗号分隔的列表形式指定。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:186
#: 505029f7668a4c549ea690dfd5625609
msgid "-\\-mavversion"
msgstr "-\\-mavversion"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:188
#: 9240dd9d9aa0470c970b5ddf30df94e8
msgid ""
"Specify MAVLink version. Can be 1.0 or 2.0. Otherwise MAVProxy will "
"autodetect the MAVLink version"
msgstr "指定 MAVLink 版本，可为 1.0 或 2.0。否则 MAVProxy 将自动检测 MAVLink 版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:191
#: 781e1d96f121450799c2dc7ab1160b5f
msgid "-\\-auto-protocol"
msgstr "-\\-auto-protocol"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:193
#: b008961d29a34ef285d0f0475061008b
msgid "Auto detect MAVLink protocol version."
msgstr "自动检测 MAVLink 协议版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:196
#: d50db7787ea54f8d902de373f126e7eb
msgid "-\\-continue"
msgstr "-\\-continue"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:198
#: 865378598f1649a0a0b22c674fd94050
msgid "Continue logs."
msgstr "继续记录日志。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:201
#: 7b6c4579e7234561a38657d5285e2183
msgid "-\\-nowait"
msgstr "-\\-nowait"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:203
#: 4f5a2e8eeff04b4ca0f6f99dce790905
msgid "Don't wait for HEARTBEAT packets on startup."
msgstr "启动时不等待 HEARTBEAT 数据包。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:206
#: b61cdb94a78b465a8f91f41cf074d701
msgid "-\\-dialect"
msgstr "-\\-dialect"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:208
#: 0a8bdd1f28d6449b9a2df97aac7a0a82
msgid "MAVLink dialect. Uses the APM dialect by default."
msgstr "MAVLink 方言。默认使用 APM 方言。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:211
#: 770a4a577ae3412da767fe1d55870146
msgid "-\\-rtscts"
msgstr "-\\-rtscts"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:213
#: a96b67734c3e460fbf2946e25896a761
msgid "Use RTS/CTS hardware flow control."
msgstr "使用 RTS/CTS 硬件流控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:216
#: aed04b4d0b064b8d8368db9199e9c49e
msgid "-\\-mission"
msgstr "-\\-mission"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:218
#: be433cfbec6347bea3177325a06b8652
msgid ""
"Give the current mission a name. If used, the flight log will be stored as "
":file:`/Logs/aircraftname/missionname` rather than the default "
":file:`/Logs/aircraftname/currentdatetime`."
msgstr ""
"为当前任务指定名称。若使用此选项，飞行日志将存储为 :file:`/Logs/aircraftname/missionname`，而非默认的 "
":file:`/Logs/aircraftname/currentdatetime`。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:223
#: a92cf21d22f347e08797fcab03d14b85
msgid "-\\-daemon"
msgstr "-\\-daemon"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:225
#: 3258e01ea9c64e18b05f3bd616b3409e
msgid ""
"Run in daemon mode (as a background process). No interactive shell will be "
"started."
msgstr "以守护进程模式（后台进程）运行。不会启动交互式 shell。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:229
#: 0bd5d65a3a2a4c91b097f90bd17a17e8
msgid "-\\-state-basedir"
msgstr "-\\-state-basedir"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:231
#: 995f8de921a5460e9fd342372467b8f1
msgid ""
"The base directory will logs are stored, if it is not the current directory."
msgstr "日志存储的基础目录（若非当前目录）。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:235
#: 48b3aacbad774b628958ced07648a1e9
msgid "-\\-version"
msgstr "-\\-version"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:237
#: 3a2153f75085401886bc3e9feb976927
msgid "Return version information about MAVProxy."
msgstr "返回 MAVProxy 的版本信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:240
#: 5feb7cdb1e1e48c2821e31f2eb750e78
msgid "-\\-moddebug"
msgstr "-\\-moddebug"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:242
#: 4a17c877c36a4af88bee3bab45179fff
msgid ""
"Controls the level of debugging output displayed on the console. Default is "
"0 (no debug output). A value of 3 is useful for debugging crashes or errors "
"in MAVProxy and its modules."
msgstr "控制控制台上显示的调试输出级别。默认为 0（无调试输出）。值为 3 时对调试 MAVProxy 及其模块的崩溃或错误非常有用。"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:247
#: 1a94072653b1407d92ef37ce823cc3e1
msgid "-\\-default-modules"
msgstr "-\\-default-modules"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:249
#: d5bdfaaa35f64baebb79cf28c62808ff
msgid ""
"A comma separated list of the modules to load on startup by default. The "
"default value of this parameter is "
"``log,signing,wp,rally,fence,param,relay,tuneopt,arm,mode,calibration,rc,auxopt,misc,cmdlong,``"
" ``battery,terrain,output,adsb,layout``"
msgstr ""
"启动时默认加载的模块列表，以逗号分隔。该参数的默认值为 "
"``log,signing,wp,rally,fence,param,relay,tuneopt,arm,mode,calibration,rc,auxopt,misc,cmdlong,``"
" ``battery,terrain,output,adsb,layout``"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:253
#: e8772b6ffb2c4a4eb7e0c25961c1feb8
msgid "-\\-non-interactive"
msgstr "-\\-non-interactive"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:255
#: 3fb3a3adfa914b1cb5aed6e927d48391
msgid "Do not start interactive shell"
msgstr "不启动交互式 shell"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:258
#: c92f0fc0e23840f18d237981416d4127
msgid "-\\-udp-timeout"
msgstr "-\\-udp-timeout"

#: ../../source/docs/getting_started/starting.rst:260
#: 17f0841a7b3743e6b48dc56d25051c1c
msgid "Timeout for udp clients in seconds"
msgstr "UDP 客户端超时时间（秒）"
